mlx-edgetam-swift
=================

From-scratch MLX-Swift architecture ports, made against Meta's official code and checkpoints, of two SAM2-family
promptable-segmentation models:

  EdgeTAM — Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates — Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/facebookresearch/EdgeTAM
  "EdgeTAM: On-Device Track Anything Model" (arXiv 2501.07256)
  Built on the SAM 2 codebase (Apache-2.0). Image encoder = RepViT-M1 (timm, Apache-2.0).
  Ported: image mode (point/box → mask) and video masklet tracking (perceiver + memory attention + memory bank).

  SAM 2.1 (Segment Anything in Images and Videos) — Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates —
  Apache License 2.0 — https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2 (arXiv 2408.00714)
  Image encoder = Hiera (Apache-2.0). Ported: image mode only (Hiera-S; tiny/base+/large configs supported).

The Swift/MLX port (`Sources/EdgeTAM`, `Sources/MLXEdgeTAM`) is original to this repository and licensed MIT
(see LICENSE). The model architectures and original weights remain Apache-2.0.

Converted MLX weights (fp16):
  https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/EdgeTAM-fp16
  https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/SAM2.1-hiera-small-fp16

Two-layer license declaration for MLXEngine admission (C7/C8):
  weight license = Apache-2.0   ·   port-code license = MIT   (both permissive).
